ext\">\n<p>[A dusty volume that speaks of the conflict between the sibling goddesses <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a>, after Selûne ignited the sun and brought life-sustaining light and warmth to the universe.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Genesis_of_Sel%C3%BBne_and_Shar\" title=\"The Genesis of Selûne and Shar\">The Genesis of Selûne and Shar</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234319\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1359/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23337/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5320/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931208/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.014      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   33.014      1 -total\n 51.93%   17.144      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.53%   15.031     15 Template:Trim\n 22.94%    7.575      2 Template:Uid\n 16.23%    5.357      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.17%    4.018      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.92%    3.605      1 Template:Books\n 10.51%    3.468      6 Template:Ifempty\n 10.21%    3.370      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3884-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234319 and revision id 387120. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}